      "notes": {
        "value": "<h2>Bismarck - Starting Statistics</h2><p>Size Medium; Speed 30 ft., fly 60 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.; AC +1 natural armor; Special Qualities: Strong against Water and Wind.</p><h3>7th-Level Advancement</h3><p>Size Large; Reach 5 ft; AC +2 natural armor; Attack bite (1d6 + 1d6 water) or slam (1d10), tail slap (1d6 + 1d6 wind); Ability Scores Str +4, Dex -2, Con +2, Cha +2</p>"
      }
